special={2:'Official NJASAP body explicitly identifies the NetJets Association of Shared Aircraft Pilots as an independent labor representative. The union is distinct from NetJets and Berkshire Hathaway.',4:'Official NetRise body names NetRise, Inc. and describes software supply-chain security. Announced acquisition or integration news is not proof of a completed ownership change.',5:'Official Netsmart body describes healthcare software and names Netsmart Technologies, Inc. in the footer.',6:'Official NETWORK Lobby body describes Catholic social-justice advocacy and explicitly distinguishes sister organization NETWORK Advocates. The two are not merged.',7:'Official NAI body identifies the Network Advertising Initiative and its privacy and advertising-industry resources. This page alone does not establish nonprofit tax classification.',8:'Official network body describes membership services for Jewish human-service organizations. Member nonprofit status is not transferred automatically to the network.',11:'Official NF Northeast body describes patient resources, research support and advocacy. Medical prevalence comparisons are not independently validated.',13:'Official Neuspera body describes neuromodulation for urinary urge incontinence. Product approval and efficacy claims are not independently verified in this pass.',16:'Official NAIA mission body explicitly identifies the New American Industrial Alliance and manufacturing-policy advocacy.',19:'Official NECC body identifies autism education, clinical services, software, research and training. Clinical outcomes are not independently evaluated.',20:'Official NECHE body identifies the commission as a nongovernmental membership accreditor serving institutions inside and outside the United States. The description corrects an overly narrow New England-only scope.',24:'Official New Leaders body describes principal preparation and professional learning and names New Leaders, Inc. in the footer.',31:'Official New York Embroidery Studio body describes embellishment and apparel manufacturing. Quality guarantees and product compliance are not independently verified.',37:'Official Next Defense Solutions body describes supplier relationships, contract administration and prototype coordination for defense customers.',40:'Official Nexteon About body explicitly explains the 2021 rebrand from Route Dynamics Corporation and describes SmartRoutes and SecureTrack.',44:'Official Nimbis body describes modeling, simulation and cloud platforms and names Nimbis Services, Inc. in the footer.',48:'Official NLMK group asset page explicitly identifies NLMK Pennsylvania and its Farrell conversion mill. The location is not treated as the entire multinational group.',54:'Official Nomi About body describes healthcare access, direct contracting, payments and analytics. Cost savings are not independently established.',55:'Official Nominal body describes hardware-testing software and names Nominal, Inc. in the footer.',58:'Official Nooks About body describes classified spaces and security services. Specific mobile facility products were omitted because this page does not substantiate them.',59:'Official NOPEC body describes Ohio community energy aggregation, education and advocacy. Advertised customer savings are not independently verified.',67:'Official NAEGA body describes grain-export contract services, arbitration and trade-policy work.',70:'Official NARA About body describes rendering-industry representation and market support. Environmental benefits claimed for rendered products are not independently established.',71:'Official NASPGHAN About body names the society and describes pediatric digestive-health research, education and professional advocacy.',72:'Official NATA body identifies private transit contractors and advocacy. It is distinct from the similarly abbreviated air-transport association.',74:'Official NCARCOG body identifies the association and its regional-council network. Services performed by member councils are not all attributed directly to the association.',75:'Official shared NCJUA-NCIUA site explicitly distinguishes North Carolina Insurance Underwriting Association as the Coastal Property Insurance Pool from the separate Joint Underwriting Association.',76:'Official North Highland body describes consulting and transformation work and names The North Highland Company as trademark owner.',79:'Official North Star Family Services body explicitly describes its 2019 name change from Montachusett Interfaith Hospitality Network, Inc. and housing support activities.',82:'Official Northwood Space body describes ground antennas, software and communications infrastructure development. Deployment-speed claims are not independently verified.',83:'Official Proof body describes identity verification and notarization and explicitly names Notarize, Inc. dba Proof.com in its footer.',84:'Official Nouryon body describes specialty chemicals and application markets. Sustainability claims are not independently established.',85:'Official NOVA Technologies body describes military engineering and training services and explicitly identifies it as an employee-owned engineering company.',87:'Official Novalith body describes hard-rock lithium refining technology. Low-impact and low-cost claims are not independently validated.',88:'Official Novig body describes peer-to-peer sports play with nonredeemable coins and a redeemable cash-prize mode. The page does not substantiate the prior regulated event-contract description; legal status and winning odds are not inferred.',91:'Official Nscale body describes AI infrastructure and names Nscale Limited. Planned facilities and offered technology are not all assumed to be operational capacity.',93:'Official Nuclear Care Partners body describes in-home care and benefits assistance for former atomic workers. Benefit eligibility and clinical outcomes are not independently established.',95:'Official Numat body names NuMat Technologies, Inc. and describes metal-organic-framework materials. Protective performance is not independently validated.',96:'Official Numeracle body names Numeracle, Inc. and describes caller identity, reputation and verification services. Anti-fraud guarantees are not adopted.',97:'Official Nuro body names Nuro, Inc. and describes autonomous-driving development. Announced 2027 services are not current operations.'}
